{"id":"044e0320-c9ac-4f8a-8e49-44c20d1c4d9e","object":"chat.completion","created":1794557430,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<title>第一天</title>\n<style>\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9;}\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n  .slide{\n    position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;\n    background:#F5F2E9;color:#1B2620;\n    font-family:\"Archivo\",\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  /* ---------- background field ---------- */\n  .bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(1100px 780px at 0% 0%,rgba(180,145,74,.10),transparent 70%),\n      radial-gradient(900px 760px at 52% 44%,rgba(140,159,178,.10),transparent 70%),\n      radial-gradient(950px 760px at 96% 96%,rgba(79,94,67,.11),transparent 72%),\n      linear-gradient(168deg,#F8F5EC 0%,#F5F2E9 52%,#EFECE1 100%);\n  }\n  .bg::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;\n    background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(27,38,32,.042) 0 1px,transparent 1px 160px);}\n  .prism{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:688px;top:-220px;width:158px;height:1560px;\n    transform:rotate(17deg);transform-origin:top left;\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(140,159,178,.20),rgba(140,159,178,.06) 70%,rgba(140,159,178,0));}\n  .prism::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:92px;top:0;width:62px;height:1560px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.36);}\n  .dots{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:1150px;top:836px;width:740px;height:210px;opacity:.20;\n    background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(27,38,32,.5) 1px,transparent 1.1px);\n    background-size:15px 15px;}\n  .gl{position:absolute;z-index:2;background:rgba(27,38,32,.05);}\n  .gl1{left:480px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n  .gl2{left:960px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n  .gl3{left:1440px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n\n  /* ---------- frame lines ---------- */\n  .top-rule{position:absolute;z-index:6;left:96px;top:52px;width:1728px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.34)}\n  .foot-rule{position:absolute;z-index:6;left:96px;top:962px;width:1728px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.22)}\n  .left-rule{position:absolute;z-index:6;left:60px;top:40px;width:1px;height:1000px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.22)}\n  .tick{position:absolute;z-index:7;left:54px;width:13px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.42)}\n  .tick.t1{top:292px}.tick.t2{top:706px}\n\n  /* ---------- meta ---------- */\n  .top-meta{position:absolute;z-index:15;left:96px;top:66px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;\n    letter-spacing:4.2px;color:#4f5b53;}\n  .rail-label{position:absolute;z-index:15;left:44px;top:520px;width:360px;height:22px;\n    transform:rotate(-90deg);transform-origin:left top;white-space:nowrap;\n    font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:5.1px;color:#637067;}\n\n  /* ---------- top-right register ---------- */\n  .register{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:-86px;top:-86px;width:304px;height:304px;border-radius:50%;\n    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.30);}\n  .register .r2{position:absolute;inset:14px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.15)}\n  .register .r3{position:absolute;inset:32px;border-radius:50%;\n    background:conic-gradient(from 210deg,rgba(79,94,67,.18),rgba(79,94,67,0) 24%,rgba(140,159,178,.28) 52%,rgba(140,159,178,.06) 78%,rgba(79,94,67,.18));}\n  .register .r4{position:absolute;inset:46px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(245,242,233,.90);\n    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.08)}\n  .register .dot{position:absolute;left:56px;top:212px;width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;\n    background:#B4914A;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(180,145,74,.14)}\n\n  /* ---------- content ---------- */\n  .content{position:absolute;z-index:10;left:96px;top:168px;width:1728px;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;}\n  .left{flex:0 0 620px;width:620px;padding-top:26px;}\n  .right{flex:1;padding-left:96px;padding-top:26px;}\n\n  .eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;\n    letter-spacing:5px;color:#B4914A;text-transform:uppercase;}\n  .eyebrow::before{content:\"\";width:34px;height:2px;background:#B4914A;display:block;}\n\n  h1{margin:20px 0 0;font-family:Georgia,\"Songti SC\",\"Noto Serif CJK SC\",\"SimSun\",serif;\n    font-size:136px;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:6px;font-weight:600;color:#141f19;}\n\n  .rule{width:124px;height:2px;background:#4F5E43;margin:30px 0 28px;}\n\n  .lede{margin:0;max-width:470px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.95;color:#4f5b53;letter-spacing:.5px;}\n\n  .status{margin-top:62px;max-width:520px;border-top:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.18);padding-top:26px;\n    display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;}\n  .s-item{display:flex;gap:15px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#333f38;}\n  .s-dot{flex:0 0 11px;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;margin-top:9px;}\n  .s-dot.solid{background:#B4914A;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(180,145,74,.13);}\n  .s-dot.hollow{border:1.6px solid #B4914A;background:transparent;}\n  .s-item .k{color:#5C665D;letter-spacing:1.5px;}\n\n  /* ---------- rows ---------- */\n  .rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;}\n  .row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.17);}\n  .row:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.17);}\n  .idx{flex:0 0 46px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:#B4914A;}\n  .key{flex:0 0 142px;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#5C665D;}\n  .val{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n  .val .txt{font-family:Georgia,\"Songti SC\",\"Noto Serif CJK SC\",\"SimSun\",serif;\n    font-size:40px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:2px;color:#18241d;}\n  .val .num{font-family:Georgia,\"Songti SC\",\"Noto Serif CJK SC\",\"SimSun\",serif;\n    font-size:76px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:1px;color:#4F5E43;font-weight:600;}\n  .val .unit{font-size:21px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#3f4a42;transform:translateY(-6px);}\n  .chip{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#5C665D;padding:6px 13px;\n    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.35);\n    transform:translateY(-6px);}\n  .badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-left:6px;padding:7px 17px;\n    border:1px dashed rgba(180,145,74,.85);border-radius:999px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:1.2px;\n    color:#8a6a2f;background:rgba(180,145,74,.08);transform:translateY(-6px);}\n  .badge::before{content:\"\";width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #B4914A;}\n\n  .list-note{margin:34px 0 0;padding-left:18px;border-left:2px solid rgba(180,145,74,.55);\n    font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:.8px;color:#5C665D;max-width:820px;}\n\n  /* ---------- footer ---------- */\n  .foot-left{position:absolute;z-index:15;left:96px;top:992px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2.4px;color:#657066;}\n  .page-no{position:absolute;z-index:15;right:96px;top:986px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;\n    letter-spacing:3.5px;color:#3f4a42;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"bg\"></div>\n  <div class=\"prism\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dots\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gl gl1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gl gl2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gl gl3\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"foot-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"left-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"tick t1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"tick t2\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-meta\">青岚市周末慢游 · 两天步行与摄影计划</div>\n  <div class=\"rail-label\">DAY 01 · 第一天 · 步行与摄影</div>\n\n  <div class=\"register\">\n    <div class=\"r2\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r3\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r4\"></div>\n    <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"left\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Day 01</div>\n      <h1>第一天</h1>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <p class=\"lede\">当天重点为拍摄与慢走，同行者按同一节奏推进。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"status\">\n        <div class=\"s-item\">\n          <span class=\"s-dot solid\"></span>\n          <span><span class=\"k\">已明确（计划）：</span>点位安排、步行上限、同行人数</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"s-item\">\n          <span class=\"s-dot hollow\"></span>\n          <span><span class=\"k\">未确定：</span>具体出发时间</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right\">\n      <div class=\"rows\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"idx\">01</div>\n          <div class=\"key\">点位安排</div>\n          <div class=\"val\"><span class=\"txt\">芦汀园 ＋ 旧街摄影</span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"idx\">02</div>\n          <div class=\"key\">步行上限</div>\n          <div class=\"val\">\n            <span class=\"num\">4.6</span>\n            <span class=\"unit\">公里</span>\n            <span class=\"chip\">当日累计控制</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"idx\">03</div>\n          <div class=\"key\">同行人数</div>\n          <div class=\"val\">\n            <span class=\"num\">5</span>\n            <span class=\"unit\">人</span>\n            <span class=\"chip\">按同一节奏推进</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"idx\">04</div>\n          <div class=\"key\">当天重点</div>\n          <div class=\"val\">\n            <span class=\"txt\">拍摄与慢走</span>\n            <span class=\"badge\">具体出发时间未确定</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"list-note\">本页呈现的是计划状态：点位、步行上限与人数已写入计划，出发时间仍待确认。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"foot-left\">青岚市周末慢游 · 第一天（计划）　|　资料为虚构测评材料</div>\n  <div class=\"page-no\">3 / 6</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>","reasoning_content":"We need to create a single HTML page 1920x1080, styled like the reference: warm paper background, serif display, thin lines, register circle, dots, etc. Content: 第一天 page, with the four bullets, page number 3/6 at bottom right.\n\nLet me design a layout: left column title \"第一天\" big serif, subtitle. Right side cards with data: 点位安排, 步行上限 4.6公里, 同行人数 5人, 当天重点 / 待定.\n\nUse CSS only, no external fonts. Use font-family with serif fallbacks: Georgia, 'Songti SC', 'Noto Serif CJK SC', serif.\n\nCareful with facts: only what's given. \"具体出发时间未确定\" — mark as 未确定 with a distinct badge style.\n\nLet me write the HTML.\n\nLayout plan:\n- Background layers: paper gradient, faint vertical repeating lines, dot field, soft prism, gridlines.\n- Top rule line, left rail with vertical label \"DAY 01 / 第一天\".\n- Top-left meta: \"青岚市周末慢游 · 两天步行与摄影计划\"\n- Top-right register circle decoration.\n- Main content: left title block at x=96, y~200: eyebrow \"第一天 / DAY ONE\", title \"第一天\" large 104px serif, then a subtitle line \"芦汀园 + 旧街摄影｜慢行拍摄为主\".\n- Right: three stat cards in a row: 步行上限 4.6 公里（当日累计控制）, 同行人数 5 人（同一节奏推进）, 点位 2 处 (hmm, \"2处\" is derived — 芦汀园 + 旧街 = 2 点位; that's a count of listed items, acceptable? It's arithmetic from provided data, but safer to say \"芦汀园 + 旧街\"). I'll avoid deriving counts. Use \"点位安排\" card listing 芦汀园、旧街摄影.\n\nBetter structure: main grid with left column (title + note) and right column (list of 4 items styled as rows with numbers/keys).\n\nDesign: Right side a \"行程参数\" panel with rows:\n1. 点位安排 — 芦汀园 + 旧街摄影\n2. 步行上限 — 4.6 公里（当日累计控制）\n3. 同行人数 — 5 人，按同一节奏推进\n4. 当天重点 — 拍摄与慢走；具体出发时间未确定 [未确定 badge]\n\nPlus a bottom strip with footer note: \"票价、交通班次、营业时间均未提供，不写入行程承诺\" — that's from principles page; maybe include a bottom note \"资料为虚构测评材料\" — that's on cover. I can include a small footnote: \"资料状态：出发时间未确定\" only. Keep to page facts. Maybe bottom bar: \"状态标记：●已明确计划 ○未确定\" legend. That's fine—it reflects the distinction requirement.\n\nLet me add a subtle distance gauge visual for 4.6公里? Could draw a horizontal scale bar with marker. Keep simple: a bar with fill representing 4.6 as \"当日上限\". Not to scale against anything—avoid implying comparison. Could show a bar labeled \"当日累计上限 4.6 km\" with tick marks. Fine, decorative.\n\nLet me write clean CSS.\n\nColors from theme:\n--bg #F5F2E9, ink #1B2620, muted #5C665D, accent1 #4F5E43, accent2 #B4914A, accent3 #8C9FB2, line #A3AC9E.\n\nStructure:\n\n```html\n<main class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"bg-field\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-a\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline g1\"></div>...\n  <div class=\"soft-prism\"></div>\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"left-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"top-meta\">青岚市周末慢游 · 两天步行与摄影计划</div>\n  <div class=\"register\">...</div>\n  <div class=\"rail-label\">DAY 01 · 第一天</div>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n     <header>...</header>\n     <div class=\"cards/rows\">...</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"footnote\">...</div>\n  <div class=\"page-no\">3 / 6</div>\n</main>\n```\n\nCareful: page number bottom right. Reference had page-no top-left; but instructions say bottom right shows \"3 / 6\". I'll put it bottom-right.\n\nLet me lay out with absolute positioning for precision.\n\nContent area: left 96px, top 200px.\n\nTitle: eyebrow small caps letterspacing; h1 \"第一天\" at 128px serif; under it a horizontal rule; subtitle.\n\nRight column: x from 900 to 1824. Rows with number labels 01–04.\n\nRow design: left key (small caps, muted, 16px letterspacing 3px), right value large (36px serif for numbers). Row height ~120, separated by 1px lines.\n\nLet me do a stacked list of 4 rows, each: index tiny number in accent gold, key label, value.\n\nRow 1: 点位安排 / 芦汀园 + 旧街摄影\nRow 2: 步行上限 / 4.6 公里 · 当日累计控制\nRow 3: 同行人数 / 5 人 · 按同一节奏推进\nRow 4: 当天重点 / 拍摄与慢走；具体出发时间未确定 [未确定徽标]\n\nBottom of right column: a small legend note.\n\nAlso add a large decorative circle or distance arc? Keep register decoration top-right.\n\nLet me also add a left vertical text label rotated.\n\nWrite CSS carefully.\n\nSlider/gauge: maybe under the title on left: a vertical stack: \"两日步行上限对照\" — no, that's day2 dat